{"ticker":"ALL","updated":"2026-11-13T22:37:15Z","profile":{"longName":"The Allstate Corporation","shortName":"Allstate Corporation (The)","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Property & Casualty","country":"United States","website":"https://www.allstate.com","fullTimeEmployees":53000,"marketCap":66227388416,"trailingPE":6.070311,"forwardPE":9.394306,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.9430071,"pegRatio":1.92,"targetMeanPrice":277.13635,"targetHighPrice":370.0,"targetLowPrice":191.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.005,"earningsGrowth":-0.424,"grossMargins":0.34865,"operatingMargins":0.21704,"profitMargins":0.16573,"totalRevenue":70229999616,"beta":0.116,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":281.11,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":191.13,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.62},"summary":"The Allstate Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, provides property and casualty, and other insurance products in the United States and Canada. It operates in four segments: Allstate Protection; Run-off Property-Liability; Protection Services; and Corporate and Other. The company offers private passenger auto, homeowners, other personal lines and commercial insurance through exclusive agents, independent agents, contact centers and online under the Allstate, National General, Direct Auto and Answer Financial brands. It also provides consumer product protection plans, device and mobile data collection services, and analytic solutions using automotive telematics information, roadside assistance, and protection plans; and insurance products, such as identity protection and restoration. In addition, the company offers property and casualty insurance, as well as engages in company activities and certain non-insurance operations, including expenses associated with strategic initiatives. Further, it offers automotive protection; vehicle service contracts, guaranteed asset protection, road hazard tires and wheels, and paintless dent repair protection; and roadside assistance, mobility data collection services, and analytic solutions using automotive telematics information, identity theft protection, and remediation services. The Allstate Corporation was founded in 1931 and is h","summary_zh":"Allstate Corporation 及其子公司在美國和加拿大提供財產和傷亡保險以及其他保險產品。它分為四個部分：Allstate Protection；徑流財產責任；保護服務；以及企業和其他。該公司透過獨家代理商、獨立代理商、聯絡中心和線上服務，以 Allstate、National General、Direct Auto 和 Answer Financial 品牌提供私人乘用車、房主、其他個人保險和商業保險。它還提供消費產品保護計劃、設備和行動資料收集服務以及使用汽車遠端資訊處理、路邊援助和保護計劃的分析解決方案；以及保險產品，例如身分保護和復原。此外，該公司還提供財產和傷亡保險，並從事公司活動和某些非保險業務，包括與策略性舉措相關的費用。此外，它還提供汽車保護；車輛服務合約、有保障的資產保護、道路危險輪胎和車輪以及免漆凹痕修復保護；路邊援助、移動數據收集服務以及使用汽車遠程資訊處理資訊的分析解決方案、身份盜竊保護和補救服務。好事達公司 (Allstate Corporation) 成立於 1931 年，是一家","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險 - 財產與意外傷害","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":200.47,"h":201.04,"l":196.69,"c":196.89,"v":1542400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":198.05,"h":198.55,"l":194.78,"c":196.3,"v":1489200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":196.71,"h":199.12,"l":196.2,"c":197.25,"v":1628100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":199.0,"h":207.27,"l":198.19,"c":205.68,"v":2215700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":206.38,"h":206.49,"l":203.9,"c":206.04,"v":3162100},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":204.23,"h":207.04,"l":204.23,"c":206.46,"v":1821900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":205.66,"h":209.23,"l":205.66,"c":207.73,"v":1241500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":207.25,"h":209.59,"l":207.11,"c":209.41,"v":967900},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":209.43,"h":210.6,"l":208.17,"c":209.82,"v":1227000},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":211.98,"h":214.25,"l":211.05,"c":212.76,"v":1156600},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":212.95,"h":213.5,"l":209.99,"c":211.28,"v":1146000},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":211.6,"h":215.7,"l":211.6,"c":214.65,"v":1563500},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":213.0,"h":214.44,"l":210.65,"c":210.68,"v":1622600},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":211.0,"h":211.17,"l":208.65,"c":210.01,"v":1369400},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":209.78,"h":211.72,"l":209.33,"c":210.82,"v":962400},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":211.0,"h":211.47,"l":208.04,"c":208.83,"v":1102100},{"t":"2025-10-